From: Bo-Cun Chen <bc-bocun.chen@mediatek.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: delay the MDIO scan

Wait 150 ms before scanning external PHYs.
This addresses stale Aeonsemi IDs on the R4 Pro 8X.
Port patch 984 from OpenWrt PR #25841 to Linux 7.3.
Keep the sleeping delay and reset callback from the referenced patch.
Hardware verification remains pending.

Origin: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/25841
Origin-Commit: 79d2df17ad98373c84bfcb412fdf1026519ee09d
Origin-Path: target/linux/mediatek/patches-6.18/984-net-ethernet-mtk_eth_soc-add-mdio-reset-delay.patch

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_eth_soc.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_eth_soc.c
@@ -510,6 +510,14 @@
 	return _mtk_mdio_read_c45(eth, phy_addr, devad, phy_reg);
 }
 
+static int mtk_mdio_reset(struct mii_bus *bus)
+{
+	/* Wait for external PHYs before scanning the MDIO bus. */
+	msleep(150);
+
+	return 0;
+}
+
 static int mt7621_gmac0_rgmii_adjust(struct mtk_eth *eth,
 				     phy_interface_t interface)
 {
@@ -1204,6 +1212,7 @@
 	eth->mii_bus->write = mtk_mdio_write_c22;
 	eth->mii_bus->read_c45 = mtk_mdio_read_c45;
 	eth->mii_bus->write_c45 = mtk_mdio_write_c45;
+	eth->mii_bus->reset = mtk_mdio_reset;
 	eth->mii_bus->priv = eth;
 	eth->mii_bus->parent = eth->dev;
 
